<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s001> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "---"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s001/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "name: implementation-django-ninja\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s001/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s003/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s003/b2>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s003/b3>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s003/b4>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s003/b5>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s001/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s005-1.2/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s005-1.2/b2>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s005-1.2/b3>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s005-1.2/b4> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2894, djr:R-2895 ;
    djr:text "description: Django Ninja JSON API 어댑터 구현 지식 — Router/Schema/Operation, controller-owned <Bc>ErrorSchema, registrar 합성, 인증·인가, 필터링·정렬·페이지네이션, Idempotency-Key, OpenAPI 계약 확인, mounted Django client HTTP 계약 검증, DRF-to-Ninja 마이그레이션. Router·Schema·API 어댑터 코드를 새로 작성하거나 리팩터링할 때 먼저 로드한다. REST 계약 설계는 architecture-api, 도메인 규칙·구조 패턴은 dddjango:architecture-ddd, Django ORM·서비스·트랜잭션은 implementation-django, 테스트 픽스처·더블 구현은 implementation-test로 위임.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s001/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "user-invocable: false\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s001/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s003> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 언제 쓰나"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s003/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2896 ;
    djr:text "\nDjango Ninja Router/Schema/Operation·controller-owned <Bc>ErrorSchema·API registrar·인증·필터링·페이지네이션·OpenAPI·mounted Django client 코드를 설계·작성할 때 로드한다. 경계:\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s003/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s005-1.2/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2897 ;
    djr:text "- REST 리소스·URL·HTTP 메서드·상태 코드·헤더·콘텐츠 협상·버전·레이트리밋·idempotency 계약(키 정책) → `architecture-api` (idempotency 저장소·retention은 `architecture-db`)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s003/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s005-1.2/b2> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2898 ;
    djr:text "- 애그리거트·상태 전이·불변식·유스케이스 경계·구조 패턴(repository/UoW/핵사고날/CQRS/outbox/ACL) → `architecture-ddd`\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s003/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s005-1.2/b3> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2899 ;
    djr:text "- ORM 쿼리·셀렉터·서비스·트랜잭션·마이그레이션·캐시·보안 구현 → `implementation-django`\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s003/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s005-1.2/b4> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2900 ;
    djr:text "- pytest 픽스처·팩토리·mock·테스트더블·동시성 테스트 구현 → `implementation-test`\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 핵심 운영 원칙"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s006-1.3/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s006-1.3/b3> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2901, djr:R-2902 ;
    djr:text "\n- Router는 HTTP 어댑터로 얇게: 요청 바인딩·auth hook·서비스 호출·응답 매핑만 (§1.3)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s016-4.1/b6>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s016-4.1/b7>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b31>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b33> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2938, djr:R-2939, djr:R-2940, djr:R-2941 ;
    djr:text "- auth 실패는 `None` 또는 framework `AuthenticationError`이며 `request.auth`에 `ErrorSchema`를 넣지 않는다. raw infra 실패는 기본 500이고, 승인된 안정 의미만 infra/ACL이 자기 BC exception으로 정규화한다 (§4·§6.2)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004/b11> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 11 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b14>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b35> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2942, djr:R-2943 ;
    djr:text "- 선언된 JSON 성공은 Schema/`Status`로 반환한다. `FileResponse`·`StreamingHttpResponse`·redirect·schema-less 204는 성공 native carveout이며 오류 응답 우회를 허용하지 않는다 (§2.2·§6.2)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004/b12> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 12 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b12>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b13> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2944, djr:R-2945 ;
    djr:text "- operation은 `summary`·`description`·`tags`로 문서화하고 반환 타입을 명시한다(`object` 금지) (§2.2)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004/b13> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 13 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7/b3>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s025-7/b8> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2946, djr:R-2947, djr:R-2948 ;
    djr:text "- Idempotency-Key는 계약에 정의된 endpoint에만; 키 정책(scope·replay·conflict)은 `architecture-api`, 저장소·retention(테이블·unique constraint·fingerprint)은 `architecture-db`가 결정 (§7)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004/b14> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 14 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b34>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s026-8/b2> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2949 ;
    djr:text "- 공개 OpenAPI 변경 후보가 `add/update`이면 mounted API의 생성 문서를 확인한다 (§8)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004/b15> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 15 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s001/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s030-10/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2950, djr:R-2951 ;
    djr:text "- 신규 API는 Django Ninja 목표, DRF는 legacy·migration 맥락에서만 보조 (§10)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004/b16> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 16 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s008-2.1/b2> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2952, djr:R-2953, djr:R-2954 ;
    djr:text "- 신규 도입 시 Django Ninja를 의존성 매니페스트에 버전 핀으로 추가(글로벌 임의 설치 금지) — 핀 표기는 프로젝트 기존 관례 (§2.1)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004/b17> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 17 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s031-11/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s031-11/b2>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s031-11/b3> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2955 ;
    djr:text "- 라우팅 결정 전 계약·DB·도메인이 미결이면 각 소유 스킬 먼저 (§11)\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s013-3.2/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2903, djr:R-2904 ;
    djr:text "- Request/Response schema는 명시적으로 분리, ModelSchema는 내부 구현 보호가 확실할 때만 (§3.1–§3.2)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1/b7> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2905, djr:R-2906, djr:R-2907, djr:R-2908 ;
    djr:text "- 발행 이벤트 봉투의 discriminator는 1종째부터 domain StrEnum + `Literal[EventType.X]` 파생(birth-enum), 버전 태그는 리터럴 동결. union-enum 동기는 중앙 test admission 후보이며 승인된 공개 wire와 독자 failure가 `add/update`일 때만 검증한다 (§3.1)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s012-3.1/b8>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s024-6.3/b3>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s026-8/b2>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s028-9.1/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s028-9.1/b3>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s028-9.1/b5> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2909, djr:R-2910, djr:R-2911, djr:R-2912, djr:R-2913, djr:R-2914 ;
    djr:text "- Schema·framework 오류·OpenAPI·HTTP 검증은 중앙 test admission 후보다. `add/update` 뒤에만 mechanics recipe를 적용하고, 공개 HTTP는 실제 URLconf에 mount된 Django client로, 공개 OpenAPI는 그 mounted API가 생성한 문서로 검증한다. 별도 승인된 공개 Python consumer가 없으면 validator 위치·`ValidationError.loc`·Pydantic/Ninja 기본 직렬화·private/helper 직접 호출은 test 자격이 아니며 오류 helper/handler 내부 unit test는 만들지 않는다 (§3·§6.3·§8·§9)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b29>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b2>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b4> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2915, djr:R-2916, djr:R-2917, djr:R-2918, djr:R-2919 ;
    djr:text "- dddjango는 공통 `FrameworkErrorSchema` property를 정하지 않는다. `reuse`는 관찰된 exact shape를 보존한다. `create`와 `approved-change`는 신규 G1 slot 6에서 field/type/required/default/nullability/모든 `Field` metadata/model config·legacy `Config`/validator/serializer/computed field/Pydantic hook inventory와 effective semantics/wire 직렬화/field 의미 전체를 일반 G1과 분리해 명시 승인받는다. 공통 오류 모듈은 `framework/ninja/framework_error_schema.py` 하나다(`framework/ninja/`는 공유 `<technology>` 폴더 — 이 계약 밖 `<module>.py`와 공존 · 명시 승인 대체 정본 `framework/django_ninja/error_schema.py` 포함 — 정본은 저장소당 하나·동시 실재 위반 2026-08-25). 승인된 common Schema의 Pydantic validator/serializer/decorator/hook은 보존 대상이며 아래 HTTP 오류 변환·handler 금지 대상이 아니다 (§6.2)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b10>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b11>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b14>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b8>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b9> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2920, djr:R-2921, djr:R-2922 ;
    djr:text "- 각 오류 BC는 `api/bc_error_schema.py` 하나에 `<Bc>ErrorCode(StrEnum)`·`<Bc>ErrorSchema`·no-arg concrete 오류를 둔다. BC/concrete는 공통 annotation/nullability·Field metadata를 보존하고(§6.2가 승인한 단일값 Literal·동일 default 병존 좁힘은 예외), 추가 필드·validator·child model_config·URI/instance·다중 오류 schema 파일은 만들지 않는다 (§6.2)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b11>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b16>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b17>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b29> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2923, djr:R-2924, djr:R-2925, djr:R-2926, djr:R-2927, djr:R-2928 ;
    djr:text "- controller는 입력 준비 뒤 정확히 한 application call만 좁은 `try`에 두고 구체 known exception을 catch한다. concrete 오류를 준비해 `Status(<승인된 HTTP status 표현>, error)`로 직접 반환하고 성공 변환은 `try` 뒤에서 한다. `status` body property는 요구하지 않는다. 오류 tuple/raw Response·dict·helper/factory/ErrorSchema→HTTP response serializer/mapper·exception handler/handler 등록 decorator·generic response builder는 금지한다 (§2.2·§6.2)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b10>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s009-2.2/b9>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b30>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s023-6.2/b34> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2929, djr:R-2930, djr:R-2931, djr:R-2932 ;
    djr:text "- 직접 반환하는 모든 BC 오류 status는 `response={...}`에 같은 BC base로 선언한다. framework-owned 401/403/route 404/422/429/일반 `HttpError`/미식별 500은 BC 오류로 변환·광고하지 않으며 body를 정확한 code-profile 계약이라 주장하지 않는다. 오류 선언의 `openapi_extra` 보충과 OpenAPI override·monkeypatch·postprocessor도 금지한다 (§6.2·§8)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b18>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b22>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b8>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/references/final.md/s010-2.3/b9> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2933, djr:R-2934, djr:R-2935, djr:R-2936, djr:R-2937 ;
    djr:text "- 프로젝트 `api.py`가 `NinjaExtraAPI` 하나를 소유하고, 명시 registrar가 소유하는 controller는 `@api_controller(..., auto_import=False)`로 auto-import/global registry side effect를 끈다. BC는 side-effect-free `register_<bc>_api(api)`를 노출하고 프로젝트 `urls.py`가 registrar를 명시 호출·mount하며, BC `composition_root/`(`dependency_wiring.py`)는 use-case DI만 소유한다 (§2.3)\n"@ko .

