<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s005/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django-ninja/SKILL.md/s005> ;
